  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice red onion.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 5-6 mins. Reduce heat to medium.\n• Stir in balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and splash of water. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648185cd38f49a2a03a2f049-804c7ae4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Grate carrot. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices\n• In a large bowl, combine haloumi, roast seasoning, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt.\n• In a small bowl, combine Dijon mustard, the mayonnaise, honey and a drizzle of olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648185cd38f49a2a03a2f049-2f91fb6d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out pan and heat to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.\n• Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato, carrot, a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648185cd38f49a2a03a2f049-92cd94a9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide salad between bowls. Top with haloumi and caramelised onion.\n• Drizzle over honey-mustard mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648185cd38f49a2a03a2f049-6b4d373a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
